-- openshop:framework 0006_openshop_drop_flow_runs_status_index
-- Generated by `openshop migrate generate`. Review before applying.

-- The claim and the expiry of runs read the partial indexes of the second
-- migration, which repeat their conditions and are ordered the way the queue
-- is read. The index on (status, available_at, created_at) of the first one
-- serves no statement of the framework any more, and every change of a run's
-- status or availability still has to update it. Dropping it loses no data.
DROP INDEX IF EXISTS flow_runs_status_available_created_idx;
